# BUILD NEXAMOR: OFFICIAL AI TRANSFORMATION PARTNER WEBSITE

Act as a world-class product designer, conversion-focused copywriter, senior full-stack engineer, brand strategist, and AI automation architect.

Build a complete, production-oriented official website for **Nexamor**, positioned as an **AI Transformation Partner (AITP)** that helps businesses automate customer communication, appointment booking, lead management, and operational workflows.

This website is our first impression for Australian business owners. It must look credible, sophisticated, technically capable, persuasive, and commercially focused.

Do not build a generic digital agency website. Do not produce only a static hero section. Build a complete, responsive website with real navigation, meaningful page sections, functional interactions, reusable components, and a professional mobile experience.

Use the existing project if one exists. Inspect its structure before making changes. If starting from scratch, use the supported React and TypeScript stack, clean component architecture, and appropriate deployment configuration.

